From: Prarit Bhargava <prarit@redhat.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] maven3.9: bump bundled org.ow2.asm:asm to 9.11

Apache Maven 3.9.16 resolves org.ow2.asm:asm 9.9.1 for maven-core and
maven-model-builder via the asmVersion property in the root pom.xml.
ASM versions 3.0 up to (but not including) 9.11 contain several denial
of service issues reachable while reading or transforming class files
(uncontrolled recursion in SignatureReader.parseType, unvalidated
BootstrapMethods/length fields leading to multi-gigabyte allocations,
missing single-RET-per-JSR validation, and unbounded COMPUTE_FRAMES
fixed-point convergence). ASM 9.11 fixes all of these. Bump the
asmVersion property so the vendored Maven Central artifact resolves to
the fixed release.

Upstream: https://gitlab.ow2.org/asm/asm/-/tags/ASM_9_11
CVE: CVE-2026-110257, CVE-2026-110258, CVE-2026-110260, CVE-2026-110261, CVE-2026-110263

---
diff --git a/apache-maven/src/main/appended-resources/licenses/unrecognized-asm-9.9.1.txt b/apache-maven/src/main/appended-resources/licenses/unrecognized-asm-9.11.txt
similarity index 100%
rename from apache-maven/src/main/appended-resources/licenses/unrecognized-asm-9.9.1.txt
rename to apache-maven/src/main/appended-resources/licenses/unrecognized-asm-9.11.txt
diff --git a/pom.xml b/pom.xml
index 117288069aeb..786c30762916 100644
--- a/pom.xml
+++ b/pom.xml
@@ -126,7 +126,7 @@ under the License.
   <properties>
     <javaVersion>8</javaVersion>
     <version.sisu-maven-plugin>1.0.0</version.sisu-maven-plugin>
-    <asmVersion>9.9.1</asmVersion>
+    <asmVersion>9.11</asmVersion>
     <classWorldsVersion>2.11.0</classWorldsVersion>
     <commonsCliVersion>1.11.0</commonsCliVersion>
     <commonsIoVersion>2.22.0</commonsIoVersion>
